<title>USA: Western Staff to buy back 100,000 shares.</title>
<headline>Western Staff to buy back 100,000 shares.</headline>
<dateline>WALNUT CREEK, Calif 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Western Staff Services Inc said on Thursday it was offering a stock repurchase programme to buy up to 100,000 shares of its outstanding common stock.</p>
<p>The company said it planned to buy the shares at a price no higher than $14 each.</p>
<p>It said the shares were needed for the Employee Stock Purchase Plan and the Employee Stock Option Plan.</p>
</text>
